  ------------------------
    WAVEFUNCTION SUMMARY
  ------------------------

  MO formalism                     : Restricted
  Calculation type                 : Hartree-Fock
  Number of atoms                  : 2
  Number of basis functions        : 60
  Primitive gaussians              : 99
  Spin density (FChk)              : not found, reconstructed from MOs
  Occupied MOs (nocc/alpha/beta)   : 5 / 5 / 5
  SCF/DFT energy (au)              :      -100.0633306036

  -----------------
    INPUT SUMMARY
  -----------------

  # METHOD
  --------
  Atomic partitioning (real-space)     : TFVC (Topological Fuzzy Voronoi Cells)

  TIMING CPU  :: initialization                                    0.00 s
  TIMING WALL :: initialization                                    0.00 s

  ----------------------------------------
    SETTING ATOMIC GRIDS FOR INTEGRATION
  ----------------------------------------

  Radial points  : 40
  Angular points : 146
  r0 (radial)    :   0.500
  Grid points    : 11680

  -----------------------------
    SETTING ATOMIC DEFINITION
  -----------------------------

  Using stiffness k: 4
  Using density along atom pairs to set atomic radii

  Atom pair   1 -   2 : 1 max / 1 min extrema; inconsistent extrema, selecting minimum closest to midpoint
  Atom pair   1 -   2 : subdivision 21, ratio  0.16279

  Checking sum of AOs overlap matrices
  (deviations may not affect overall accuracy of MOs)

  TIMING CPU  :: atomic definition                                 0.03 s
  TIMING WALL :: atomic definition                                 0.03 s

